      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the minimum order quantity for sports bras?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Our minimum order quantity for custom sports bras is 300 pieces per style. This minimum allows you to access factory-direct pricing while testing market response with manageable inventory. The 300-piece minimum can be distributed across sizes within a single colorway. Lower quantities are available for sampling and prototype development at higher per-piece costs for brands requiring smaller initial runs."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What support levels do you offer for sports bras?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We manufacture sports bras in three support levels: low impact for yoga, pilates, and walking; medium impact for cycling, hiking, and strength training; and high impact for running, HIIT, and team sports. Support level is determined through fabric selection, construction methods, and design features such as band width and strap configuration. We can help you select the appropriate support level for your target market and intended activities."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do you offer sports bras with removable cups?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Removable cup options are available across all support levels. We offer standard foam cups in varying thicknesses, molded cups for enhanced shaping, and padding options for modesty. Cup pockets are constructed with secure closures to prevent shifting during activity. Removable cups add approximately $0.50-1.00 per piece depending on cup type and can be omitted for customers who prefer unpadded styles."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What fabric options are available for sports bras?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We offer nylon-spandex blends (80/20 or 82/18) for premium performance with superior stretch and recovery, polyester-spandex blends for durability and color retention, recycled polyester-spandex certified by GRS for sustainable options, and moisture-wicking mesh panels for ventilation. Fabric GSM ranges from 200-280 depending on support requirements, with higher GSM providing more compression and support for high-impact activities."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can you produce strappy and fashion-forward sports bra designs?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. We produce strappy back designs, racerback configurations, cross-back straps, keyhole cutouts, and other fashion-forward details. Complex strap designs require specialized construction techniques to maintain support while achieving aesthetic goals. Our pattern makers ensure that decorative elements do not compromise structural integrity. Fashion styles typically have a 500-piece minimum due to increased production complexity compared to standard designs."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does sports bra production take?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Standard production timeline is 30-40 days from fabric receipt for basic sports bras. Custom fabric development adds 15-20 days. Sampling takes 15-20 days before bulk production approval. Complex designs with strappy details or custom molding may require 35-45 days production time. We recommend planning 60-75 days total from initial inquiry to delivery for first-time orders including sampling and production."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Sports Bra Manufacturing Service",
      "description": "Custom sports bra manufacturing from 300 pieces including low, medium, high impact support levels with removable cups and racerback designs",
